+ * @actions: If nonnull, its variable-length value is passed to userspace as
+ * %OVS_PACKET_ATTR_ACTIONS.
+ * @actions_len: The length of the @actions.
  * @portid: Netlink portid to which packet should be sent.  If @portid is 0
